<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Direct Answer Prompt</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This prompt serves as a baseline reasoning setup, asking the model to solve a problem
directly without external strategy guidance or example-based hints.</p>
</div>
