<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Strategy Guidance Prompt</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This prompt evaluates the effect of explicit strategy-level guidance by providing the
model with strategies extracted from similar problems and instructing it to use them
during solution construction.</p>
</div>
