<section id="A2.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.5 </span>Strategy Adherence Verification Prompt</h3>

<div id="A2.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This prompt evaluates whether a specific target strategy was actually used—and correctly
executed—in a given reasoning trace, enabling fine-grained analysis of strategy
executability.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS5.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="62.15" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 62.15" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,62.15) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 56.25 C 0 59.51 2.64 62.15 5.91 62.15 L 471.47 62.15 C 474.73 62.15 477.38 59.51 477.38 56.25 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 38.04 L 475.41 38.04 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 46.64)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:27.28em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="377.48"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS5.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:27.28em;">
